stateDiagram-v2
    state "Check device_state()" as CheckState
    state "Factory Default" as FactoryDefault
    state "Setup Pending" as SetupPending
    state "Operational" as Operational
    state "WiFi Reconfig" as WifiReconfig
    state "Wait for SSID (15 retries)" as WaitSSID
    state "Setup Start Screen" as SetupStart
    state "Setup Error" as SetupError
    state "WiFi Connecting" as WifiConnecting
    state "Setup Connect Info" as SetupConnectInfo
    state "Connect Info (10s)" as ConnectInfo
    state "Scene Cycler (widgets)" as SceneCycler

    [*] --> CheckState
    CheckState --> FactoryDefault: is_factory_default()
    CheckState --> SetupPending: is_setup_pending()
    CheckState --> Operational: else
    CheckState --> WifiReconfig: is_wifi_reconfig()

    FactoryDefault --> WaitSSID
    WaitSSID --> SetupStart: SSID found
    WaitSSID --> SetupError: timeout then reboot

    SetupPending --> WifiConnecting
    WifiConnecting --> SetupConnectInfo: IP found
    WifiConnecting --> SetupError: no IP

    Operational --> ConnectInfo
    ConnectInfo --> SceneCycler: set_scene_cycler(true)

    WifiReconfig --> WaitSSID

    SetupStart --> SceneCycler: via run_initial_setup_listener
